  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Discussion of Commands and Actions</h2>\n<p>The speaker discusses the use of &#x27;heat&#x27; and the commands &#x27;triangle and X&#x27;, emphasizing their utility in defense and combat. The &#x27;triangle and X&#x27; command is repeatedly mentioned as a key action, and the speaker confirms its use in various contexts, including when using &#x27;heat smash&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Acquisition of Outfits and Costs</h2>\n<p>There is a discussion about acquiring the main outfit, which is necessary for progressing in the game. The speaker confirms that the main outfit must be purchased, and there is an inquiry about its cost.</p>\n<h2>Repetitive Actions and Low Positions</h2>\n<p>The speaker repeatedly says &#x27;okay&#x27; and &#x27;down&#x27;, indicating a focus on maintaining a low position. This is linked to a character&#x27;s low stance and the need to be cautious about their ankle condition.</p>\n<h2>Character Behavior and Instructions</h2>\n<p>There is a mention of a character&#x27;s strange behavior, which is being observed and discussed. The speaker instructs someone to &#x27;come here&#x27; and acknowledges that the situation is changing.</p>\n<h2>Character Background and Identity</h2>\n<p>A character is described as being raised by an old man and referred to as &#x27;Shiro kuma&#x27; or &#x27;white bear&#x27;. This identity is linked to a farmer and a specific bear-like character.</p>\n<h2>Location and Environment</h2>\n<p>A secluded location is mentioned, possibly with puddles, and described as intense. The speaker also discusses being in a &#x27;puddle world&#x27; and expressing fear about the environment.</p>\n<h2>Actions and Reactions</h2>\n<p>The speaker repeatedly blocks something and encourages celebrating small victories. There is also a discussion about whether to perform a full action and a moment of hesitation before taking a break.</p>\n<h2>Observations and Feedback</h2>\n<p>The speaker notices a hand in the back and dislikes it, affirming their observation. There is also feedback about achieving perfection and being free from a wall, though the speaker is still stuck against their subconsciousness.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bj8yvIhvGr0</p>",
